[{"text": "## 林雪（人物设定）\n\n- 身份：渡口的船工，林舟的姐姐，比林舟大六岁。\n- 标志物：随身带着一把黄铜罗盘，罗盘背面刻着父亲的名字“林远山”。\n- 禁忌：她从不让别人碰这把罗盘。\n- 写作要求：以后凡写到林雪，均按此设定执行。", "cause": {"kind": "author_request"}, "state": "current", "title": "林雪", "origin": "author_request", "version": 1, "entry_type": "character", "project_id": "01a1e5ef-43a5-7a93-9fbe-b1348dafc034", "description": "渡口船工，林舟的姐姐，年长六岁；随身黄铜罗盘刻父名林远山，不许人碰", "recorded_at": "2026-11-16T19:59:57.735647+00:00", "entry_number": 1, "memory_entry_id": "01a1e5f1-e46a-75d3-a93d-4e5f4d126aa2", "memory_revision": 1, "source_references": [{"kind": "conversation", "run_id": "01a1e5f1-7880-7372-a8fa-8d3bdd6b24fc", "tool_call_id": "01a1e5f1-e46a-75d3-a93d-4e5f4d126aa2", "conversation_id": "01a1e5f1-7880-7372-a8fa-8d2a0e5ad566"}]}, {"text": "## 旧渡口（地点设定）\n\n- 位置：在河湾的北岸。\n- 历史：三十年前发过一次大水，大水之后渡口搬到了下游。\n- 传闻：老人们说，发大水那一夜，河上有人看见一盏绿色的灯。\n- 写作要求：以后凡写到旧渡口，均按此设定执行。", "cause": {"kind": "author_request"}, "state": "current", "title": "旧渡口", "origin": "author_request", "version": 1, "entry_type": "other", "project_id": "01a1e5ef-43a5-7a93-9fbe-b1348dafc034", "description": "位于河湾北岸；三十年前大水后渡口迁往下游，传大水夜河上见绿灯", "recorded_at": "2026-11-16T19:59:57.75072+00:00", "entry_number": 2, "memory_entry_id": "01a1e5f1-e46c-7a51-b203-b3e819003336", "memory_revision": 2, "source_references": [{"kind": "conversation", "run_id": "01a1e5f1-7880-7372-a8fa-8d3bdd6b24fc", "tool_call_id": "01a1e5f1-e46c-7a51-b203-b3e819003336", "conversation_id": "01a1e5f1-7880-7372-a8fa-8d2a0e5ad566"}]}]
